OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FPeople across the South West are
OL,8,Fpreparing to witness the most dramatic
OL,9,Fsolar eclipse in almost 30 years.
OL,11,FMore than 90% of the sun will be
OL,12,Fblocked by the moon between 6.17pm and
OL,13,F8.06pm on Wednesday, the best coverage
OL,14,Fsince the total eclipse in 1999.
OL,16,FShoppers have been queuing up outside
OL,17,Fhigh street stores across the region
OL,18,Fto track down a pair of special
OL,19,Fglasses ahead of the eclipse, which
OL,20,Fwill be the country's fullest for the
OL,21,Fnext 54 years.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
