OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FPeople in Devon and Cornwall are set
OL,8,Fto see the eclipse at its fullest,
OL,9,Fwith a range of 94% to 96% of the sun
OL,10,Fobscured by the moon.
OL,12,FLands End is one of the best places in
OL,13,Fthe UK to see the partial solar
OL,14,Feclipse, and crowds have started
OL,15,Fgathering on the peninsula to grab a
OL,16,Fviewing spot.
OL,18,FJames Otter has travelled to Land's
OL,19,FEnd from Yorkshire to experience the
OL,20,Fpartial solar eclipse.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
