OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FHe said: "We've come down on holiday -
OL,8,Fyou can't really get a better sight
OL,9,Fthan on Land's End, can you?"
OL,11,FCrowds have started gathering at
OL,12,FLand's End to view the spectacle
OL,14,FNate Jolly travelled to Land's End for
OL,15,Fthe total eclipse in 1999, and said:
OL,16,F"To be down here again for the partial
OL,17,Feclipse is really cool. I can't wait."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
