OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FMeanwhile, in Bristol, hundreds of
OL,8,Fpeople have been gathering at the Sea
OL,9,FWalls viewpoint, where the Bristol
OL,10,FAstronomical Society is hosting a
OL,11,Fviewing event together with Bristol's
OL,12,FWe The Curious and the Friends of the
OL,13,FDowns and Avon Gorge.
OL,15,FA solar eclipse happens when the Moon
OL,16,Fpasses between the Earth and the Sun,
OL,17,Fblocking some or all of the Sun's rays
OL,18,Ffrom hitting Earth.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
