SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786560487
OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FExperts have warned people against
OL,8,Fusing "knock-off" glasses to watch the
OL,9,Frare celestial event and eye doctors
OL,10,Fhave urged people to avoid looking
OL,11,Fdirectly at the sun, with even brief
OL,12,Fexposure causing lasting vision damage.
OL,14,FOnly special solar eclipse glasses
OL,15,Fthat are ISO 12312-2 certified for the
OL,16,Fsafest eye protection should be used
OL,17,Fto view the eclipse and sunglasses are
OL,18,Fnot sufficient, the UK Health Security
OL,19,FAgency said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
