OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FDozens of people queued up outside a
OL,8,Ftoyshop in Weymouth earlier today,
OL,9,Fhoping to get their hands on some last-
OL,10,Fminute glasses.
OL,12,FQueues of people lining the streets in
OL,13,FWeymouth ahead of tonight's spectacle
OL,15,FHowever, if you were unable to grab a
OL,16,Fpair of eclipse glasses, do not worry,
OL,17,Fas there are still safe ways to enjoy
OL,18,Fthe event.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
