OL,3,CExcitement builds as South West
OL,4,Cprepares for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FDavid Jones, a consultant
OL,8,Fophthalmologist at Royal Cornwall
OL,9,FHospitals Trust, has shared a range of
OL,10,Fsimple DIY viewing methods on social
OL,11,Fmedia, showing how people can watch
OL,12,Fthe eclipse safely without looking
OL,13,Fdirectly at the Sun or needing
OL,14,Fspecialist equipment.
OL,16,FDavid Jones, a consultant
OL,17,Fophthalmologist, shares his DIY tips
OL,18,Fon safely viewing the eclipse without
OL,19,Flooking directly at the Sun. Credit:
OL,20,FRoyal Cornwall Hospitals Trust
